  "analysis_summary": "This class structure provides a foundational framework but is critically incomplete for D96A EANCOM INVOIC. You have ~22 classes but are missing 60-70% of required segment types, composite structures, and business rule enforcement mechanisms. The structure conflates abstract concepts (BusinessProcess, ValidationConstraint) with concrete EDIFACT elements, creating semantic ambiguity.",

  "completeness_score": 0.35,

