      "priority": "high",
      "rationale": "MANDATORY. Document Date (DTM+137) is required in every INVOIC message per EANCOM D96A. Without this, temporal context is lost. Must support qualifiers: 137 (Document), 35 (Delivery), 263 (Invoice Period Start), 264 (Invoice Period End)."
    },
    {
      "type": "class",
      "name": "RFF_Segment",
