:EDIFACT_INVOIC_Ontology a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "EDIFACT INVOIC Ontology" ;
    rdfs:comment "A deeply structured ontology for UN/EDIFACT D96A INVOIC messages, covering all mandatory and recommended segments, roles, and business processes, aligned with EN 16931-1 and P2P-O." .

