### Classes
:P2POEntity rdf:type owl:Class ;
  rdfs:label "P2P-O Entity" ;
  rdfs:comment "Entity defined in the Purchase-to-Pay Ontology. Superclass of Organization, Item, Price, Tax, Address." .

